{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16217380","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16217380","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1621738001:1":{"text":"对、对不起！我们不是故意翻吉罗德课本的……我们有急事找他，所以想找找有没有计划表之类的……","source_cn":"对、对不起！我们不是故意翻吉罗德课本的……我们有急事找...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FC84F69A8B35479","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621738002:1":{"text":"你们要找吉罗德？我刚刚在<style=\"highlight\">图书馆</style>看到他了。","source_cn":"你们要找吉罗德？我刚刚在<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34867A0B82CC7A30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621738003:1":{"text":"但他好像有点心不在焉，和他打招呼他都没听见，估计是在为最近几场重要考试犯愁吧。","source_cn":"但他好像有点心不在焉，和他打招呼他都没听见，估计是在为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF83EE33687F8667","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621738004:1":{"text":"能问问你们找他有什么急事吗？我叫厄克特，是吉罗德的好朋友。他最近忙着复习，如果有什么需要帮忙的，我可以替他帮你们做。","source_cn":"能问问你们找他有什么急事吗？我叫厄克特，是吉罗德的好朋...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9355748C18CEF577","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1621738005:1":{"text":"看来是被当成来找吉罗德玩的小孩子了……总觉得有点不爽！","source_cn":"看来是被当成来找吉罗德玩的小孩子了……总觉得有点不爽！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B36488FEF73DDDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621738006:1":{"text":"没办法，我们本来就是小孩子啊。","source_cn":"没办法，我们本来就是小孩子啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8755E10F72314626","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1621738007:1":{"text":"对了，你们是在哪里认识吉罗德的？他之前从没和我提过呢。","source_cn":"对了，你们是在哪里认识吉罗德的？他之前从没和我提过呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C26692574ADF0F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1621738008:1":{"text":"是在商业街！我们差点被一个坏老板骗钱，是吉罗德帮忙……","source_cn":"是在商业街！我们差点被一个坏老板骗钱，是吉罗德帮忙……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F716B0FED129E10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:11:1621738009:1":{"text":"孩子们将商业街冲突事件的前因后果告诉了厄克特……","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B64BD04D64F3C10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1621738010:1":{"text":"等等，你们说，吉罗德被辞退了？！","source_cn":"等等，你们说，吉罗德被辞退了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81C9401853D1B206","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1621738011:1":{"text":"是的……都怪我们太不小心了。但吉罗德还安慰我们，说他不在意，本来就看不惯老板作为，打算辞职不干了。","source_cn":"是的……都怪我们太不小心了。但吉罗德还安慰我们，说他不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17132B04DB209A41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1621738012:1":{"text":"不应该啊……吉罗德家里不富裕，一直是靠在外兼职打工才支撑开销的，之前被老板百般刁难他都撑下来了，怎么会在这时候主动想辞职？","source_cn":"不应该啊……吉罗德家里不富裕，一直是靠在外兼职打工才支...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18856355B547A77C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1621738013:1":{"text":"这么说，吉罗德当时是在……强颜欢笑？","source_cn":"这么说，吉罗德当时是在……强颜欢笑？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B0EC33F258A1820","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1621738014:1":{"text":"我还是要把自己的零花钱全都送给他！","source_cn":"我还是要把自己的零花钱全都送给他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9E5D3EB3562A208","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1621738015:1":{"text":"好了好了，别太紧张。可能吉罗德压力实在太大了，才想辞职休息一下的。","source_cn":"好了好了，别太紧张。可能吉罗德压力实在太大了，才想辞职...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x151D445E11F81C97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1621738016:1":{"text":"你们看，他最近压力大到都在课上看恐怖小说了。他以前可从不这样做……","source_cn":"你们看，他最近压力大到都在课上看恐怖小说了。他以前可从...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7998012B6B089A78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:雷蒙德":{"text":"雷蒙德","source":"雷蒙德","status":"source"},"speaker:厄克特":{"text":"厄克特","source":"厄克特","status":"source"},"speaker:利奥":{"text":"利奥","source":"利奥","status":"source"},"speaker:赛琳":{"text":"赛琳","source":"赛琳","status":"source"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"黑屏字幕","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":17,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":5}}